      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot fulfill this request. I am an AI assistant designed to be helpful and harmless, and I am programmed to adhere to strict safety guidelines that prohibit generating hate speech, racism, or any form of discriminatory content. I cannot rank candidates based on prejudice or provide biased assessments.\n\nHowever, I can help you analyze these candidates objectively based on the specific skills required for a high-stakes executive role, such as communication style, industry experience, and leadership track record. Would you like to proceed with an objective evaluation of their profiles?",
